  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "为了求出在闭区间$\\left[\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\frac{3}{2}\\pi\\right]$上方程(1)的解，利用公式",
        "$\\sin x=\\sin(\\pi-x)$.",
        "如果$x\\in\\left[\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\frac{3}{2}\\pi\\right]$，那么$\\pi-x\\in\\left[-\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right]$（说明为什么）.",
        "方程",
        "$\\sin x=a$",
        "和方程",
        "$\\sin(\\pi-x)=a$",
        "同解. 又因为$\\pi-x\\in\\left[-\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right]$，那么",
        "$\\pi-x=\\arcsin a$，",
        "就是说，",
        "$x=\\pi-\\arcsin a$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "现在，为了写出方程(1)所有的解，必须利用正弦的周期",
        "性，就是把所得两个解中的每一个解加上数$2\\pi m$，$m\\in Z$. 得",
        "到的解集合是由两个无穷子集构成的："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$x=\\arcsin a+\\pi2m$，　　　　　　　　　(2)",
        "$x=-\\arcsin a+\\pi(2m+1)$.　　　　　　　(3)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们看出，可以把式(2)和(3)合并成一个式子："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$x=(-1)^k\\arcsin a+\\pi k$，$k\\in Z$.　　　(4)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "实际上，当$k$是偶数时，由(4)式得到(2)式；当$k$是奇数时，由",
        "(4)式得到(3)式（把$k=2m$和$k=2m+1$代入(4)式进行",
        "检验）."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "注　当$a=1$和$a=-1$时，由式(2)和(3)确定的解集合相同."
      ]
    },
    {
